        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-004724",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In July 2024, we received Breakthrough Device Designation from the FDA for our nsPFA Cardiac Surgery System for the treatment of AF.",
        "start_character": 9500,
        "end_character": 9632
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-004724",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-004724-8e583365bc8c94c4",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-004724",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In parallel, we have designed a variety of applicators, or disposables, to explore the potential use of the nPulse platform to treat disorders in other medical specialties, such as cardiology, gastroenterology, gynecology, and otolaryngology.",
        "start_character": 776,
        "end_character": 1018
